# VHS M1: the C270's largest MJPEG mode is 4:3: the whole frame with a border left and right (never cropped).
# exposure_auto_priority is set to 0 at open (the log line).
title VHS M1 with a Logitech C270 on a Pi 4B class board: 1280x960 (no 1080p) pillarboxed in the 16:9 box
sizes 800x480 720x720
env VHS_FORMAT rgb565
env VHS_FAKE c270
env VHS_SOC bcm2711

wait 1500
shot 01-c270
expect text "1280x960  30 fps"
@800x480 expect text "C270 HD WEBCAM, MJPEG. Space takes a photo, Tab switches to Video, R records."
@720x720 expect text "C270 HD WEBCAM - MJPEG"
@720x720 expect text "Space - Tab - R"
key esc
expect quit
